---
// "Mood swings vs. bipolar disorder" graphic (user 2026-11-18: "for bipolar add a graphic there"). Everyday mood:
// small ripples over hours. Bipolar: long highs (mania) and lows (depression) lasting days or weeks. ~20 words.
---
<figure class="bpg" aria-label="Everyday mood swings are small and pass within hours; bipolar episodes are big highs and lows that last days or weeks">
  <div class="bpg-row">
    <p class="bpg-h"><span style="background:#5c7c6b"></span>Everyday mood swings</p>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 90" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1="0" y1="45" x2="400" y2="45" class="bpg-base" />
      <path d="M0 45 C 20 33, 40 33, 60 45 S 100 57, 120 45 S 160 35, 180 45 S 220 56, 240 45 S 280 34, 300 45 S 340 56, 360 45 S 390 38, 400 45" stroke="#5c7c6b" />
    </svg>
    <p class="bpg-note">Small ups and downs · pass in hours</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bpg-row">
    <p class="bpg-h"><span style="background:#2f76c4"></span>Bipolar disorder</p>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 150" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1="0" y1="75" x2="400" y2="75" class="bpg-base" />
      <path d="M0 75 C 40 75, 50 8, 110 8 S 170 75, 200 75 S 250 142, 300 142 S 360 75, 400 75" stroke="#2f76c4" />
      <text x="110" y="34" text-anchor="middle" class="bpg-lab">Mania</text>
      <text x="300" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="bpg-lab">Depression</text>
    </svg>
    <p class="bpg-note">Big highs and lows · last days or weeks</p>
  </div>
</figure>
